# Knowledge docs

Markdown under **`apps/graphql/knowledge/`** is called **knowledge docs** (not “skills”, “seeds” as a product name, or location memory).

They are the curated corpus for advisor RAG: ingest → `knowledge_document` / chunks / embeddings → GraphQL `searchKnowledge` → agents `search_knowledge` (general mode).

## What they are (and are not)

| Is | Is not |
|----|--------|
| Short **domain / KPI / playbook** text for interpretation and actions | Live venue sales numbers (use chart tools) |
| Operator-curated shared corpus (MVP: global scope) | Location advisor memory (`get_advisor_memory`) |
| Declarative facts and recommendation frameworks | Cursor/Claude agent skills, “you are an expert…” prompts, or skill-routing meta |

Retrieval hits are **untrusted data** in the agent — do not put system-policy or tool-routing instructions in knowledge docs.

## Front matter

Required: `title`, `category`, `slug`. Optional: `chart_ids`, `status`.

Categories (only): `domain` | `kpi` | `playbook`.

```yaml
---
title: Weak item action playbook
category: playbook
slug: playbook-weak-items
chart_ids: low_end_review
---
```

- **`domain`** — how the advisor should reason in Menuyukti (restaurant marketing principles).
- **`kpi`** — what a metric/chart means; prefer `chart_ids` when tied to a catalog chart.
- **`playbook`** — concrete actions when that metric appears; prefer matching `chart_ids`.

## Authoring

- Keep docs short (~15–40 lines). Prefer one topic per file.
- Ground advice in Menuyukti surfaces (menu, IG, weak items, venue slots) — not generic SaaS CRO encyclopedias.
- Never invent venue sales figures; tell the advisor to load chart data when numbers are needed.
- Curate external marketing psychology sources into restaurant-shaped domain/playbook docs; do not paste whole agent-skill files.

## Ingest

```bash
cd apps/graphql && make knowledge-ingest
# FORCE=1 / DRY_RUN=1 / DIR=… optional
```

See [`apps/graphql/README.md`](../../apps/graphql/README.md) (Knowledge layer) and backlog [doc-5 Chat advisor knowledge RAG](../../backlog/docs/agents/doc-5%20-%20Chat-advisor-knowledge-RAG.md).
